Again sorta bogus.  Trip times are limited by how fast one can
accelerate the other end.  Subjective times are from how fast one can
run a brain.  These need not be related.  Nanotech might increase the
later without increasing the former, or even vise versa.  Why not just
give another column in your table for times given a million gee?  

